</ul></div></div><div class='sticky_placeholder'></div>{% set introText %}<p>Discover the magic of winter at Waldgeflüster! While others hibernate, this is when things get truly cozy here. In the heart of nature, surrounded by snow-covered trees and twinkling lights, you’ll experience Christmas parties, birthdays, and winter events that are guaranteed to stay unforgettable. Planning a company Christmas party or a celebration with friends? With us, your winter event in the forest becomes one of a kind: mulled wine, Bavarian curling &#038; wintry ambiance included.</p>
{% endset %}
{{ intro(introText) }}{% call zigzag({ id: 'eisstock', row: 'av-20jhvn-ac21fa1f5e933bb898e22471788c218c', cellA: 'av-m69g2fy9-4c16524b2424a472a13b26a355893d72', cellB: 'av-m69g3goh-9d5841147cc5ebcef1bed602bfc23ada', cellAExtra: ' avia-full-stretch', cellBExtra: ' avia-full-stretch', reverse: true, hr: 'av-7zlhar-deb373a7b4a9cc04b799513d46efae89', icon: 'av-sxa3n-60b3396a081fbbf38455be4192f42ca7', dir: 'rechts', char: '' }) %}
<div  class='av-special-heading av-m69h0z5i-d7fab9ca7e9ee6596cf0632a5b061c48 av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading  avia-builder-el-8  el_before_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-first '><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop="headline"  >The Venue – Celebrations in the Heart of the Forest</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section  class='av_textblock_section av-m69h11vm-1bf22103365ae4fd383f97dd92f2cf79 '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock av_inherit_color'  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1"><span class="s1">In winter, </span><b>Waldgeflüster</b><span class="s1"> transforms into a truly special </span><b>winter and Christmas venue on the Swabian Alb</b><span class="s1">. </span>Amid twinkling lights, a crackling fire, and a snow-covered forest backdrop, an atmosphere emerges that warms the heart and soul.</p>
<ul>
<li>Heated indoor area with bar, dance floor, light &#038; sound system</li>
<li>Room for up to 40 guests (seated)</li>
<li>Bavarian curling lane, fire pit with lounge seating</li>
<li>2,000 m² of outdoor space with winter lighting &#038; forest backdrop</li>
</ul>
</div></section>
{% endcall %}
{% call zigzag({ id: 'av-layout-grid-2', row: 'av-3qoiab-28e21722a495823f3eb5573d9ca62e4c', cellA: 'av-m69g0suv-9a07d853d48cb7eb8533b6a45924abbf', cellB: 'av-1yah7n-269fe5caf03f5119b2aee87c3c3eba97', cellAExtra: ' avia-full-stretch', arrowFirst: true, hr: 'av-3pzfib-a00a9f75d70b507038feda593c1cb33c', icon: 'av-9wjh5f-74e7953a7cbab43bfa22758075d25e75', dir: 'links', char: '' }) %}
<div  class='av-special-heading av-9rhxnn-b61a072a66cbb7e01f0a33400b0caa0e av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading  avia-builder-el-18  el_before_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-first '><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop="headline"  >Bavarian Curling – Fun <span class='special_amp'>&amp;</span> Action</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section  class='av_textblock_section av-71x7bn-28ea30763d5a23df4235ab9efde81fa7 '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock av_inherit_color'  itemprop="text" ><p>A highlight of every winter celebration: our <strong>Bavarian curling</strong> is the perfect combination of entertainment and friendly athletic fun. Whether you’re seasoned players or complete beginners – the fun always comes first. Organize tournaments, cheer on your colleagues and friends, or simply enjoy the relaxed mood this wintry activity brings with it. It’s a part of the program that’s guaranteed to deliver plenty of laughs and exciting moments.</p>
</div></section>
{% endcall %}{% call zigzag({ id: 'eisstock-details', row: 'av-cu5rv7-692d1703688039e8c8e9cdfd34f53dbc', cellA: 'av-abeger-e53c2dc33b4de592f987b2ad1e1b86e1', cellB: 'av-5zrqvn-57c3fefc1f63f4d4bf56e76c69a05480', cellAExtra: ' avia-full-stretch', cellBExtra: ' avia-full-stretch', reverse: true, hr: 'av-403l2r-a22acf566c2c09f60b12657574d444b7', icon: 'av-39k2xf-04175376267411896870e84519226c6f', dir: 'rechts', char: '' }) %}
<div  class='av-special-heading av-d3cx5v-4ac3d31ab2489b02bbc41fe5ab0d122a av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading  avia-builder-el-22  el_before_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-first '><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop="headline"  >Mulled Wine Reception – the Perfect Start to the Evening</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section  class='av_textblock_section av-a6920z-57ebc6f470161c168a35bcabdf0f4239 '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock av_inherit_color'  itemprop="text" ><p>Start your winter event with a <strong>mulled wine reception</strong> in the middle of an enchanting winter setting. At Waldgeflüster, every Christmas party begins with a smile and a warming cup in hand. Our team welcomes your guests with hot drinks like mulled wine, punch, or hot chocolate, while you let yourselves be enchanted by sparkling string lights, atmospheric lighting, and wintry decorations. The crisp winter air and the cozy atmosphere set the stage for the perfect start to your celebration.</p>
</div></section>
{% endcall %}{% call zigzag({ id: 'av-layout-grid-4', row: 'av-ffmeer-fbe71b11518ff95335b7da548c3d86ee', cellA: 'av-m69h1oq1-c6dd7e77e03327f8393f013c8eb1d035', cellB: 'av-1b602r-9bd1edaeee5ee5eb28659b363e4ae8f2', cellAExtra: ' avia-full-stretch', arrowFirst: true, hr: 'av-5tx9pv-6e444c6ebc3fa99b28885aec92b52b63', icon: 'av-63gmtv-0321a7782ac196fd55f2e4351ae48f08', dir: 'links', char: '' }) %}
<div  class='av-special-heading av-m69gzp38-72f2a166a3decd627a483d72b7f7b4d9 av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading  avia-builder-el-32  el_before_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-first '><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop="headline"  >Festive Dinner – Winter Cuisine with Heart</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section  class='av_textblock_section av-m69gzxvu-84641e92c8811bc95016c721b00e1fac '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock av_inherit_color'  itemprop="text" ><p>After an atmospheric reception and a round of Bavarian curling, we invite you to a <strong>festive dinner</strong>. Together with our experienced catering partners, we serve you regional winter menus, festive buffets, and Christmas specialties &#8211; your culinary enjoyment takes center stage. Pair your dinner with our beverage service, ranging from fine wines to wintry cocktails. The focus is on quality, regional sourcing, and atmosphere &#8211; turning your evening into a delight for all the senses.</p>
</div></section>
{% endcall %}{% call zigzag({ id: 'av-layout-grid-5', row: 'av-bi0vlv-1c526537d16f2f779d48431a98217e0a', cellA: 'av-9ejjj7-26bb1b032e227aef729c4ed7a20b2f1e', cellB: 'av-m69h33e5-4cae9b3c5462a4da24b3da45e39aacfb', cellAExtra: ' avia-full-stretch', cellBExtra: ' avia-full-stretch', reverse: true, hr: 'av-3nc1v7-1e3d0a33c2b73015624cc219f3b7927e', icon: 'av-3i2slf-1c0b7330c5b8cfe366a13034dec54ee7', dir: 'rechts', char: '' }) %}
<div  class='av-special-heading av-m69h0erb-a66bbe21d361b553d264929a66e79aaa av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading  avia-builder-el-36  el_before_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-first '><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop="headline"  >Campfire <span class='special_amp'>&amp;</span> Cozy Togetherness</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section  class='av_textblock_section av-m69h0liq-c03c2bd487196ad71d3c7eab25b12d84 '   itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ><div class='avia_textblock av_inherit_color'  itemprop="text" ><p class="p1">The fire pit blazes, the lights twinkle, conversations grow softer, the laughter lingers. Here you can let the evening wind down in peace – with mulled wine, music, and a feeling of togetherness. Cozy blankets, marshmallows for roasting, and a selection of hot drinks create a warm and truly special atmosphere. The <span class="s1"><b>campfire at Waldgeflüster</b></span> is the perfect place for unforgettable moments and the closing of your Christmas party.</p>
</div></section>
{% endcall %}{% set secTitle1 %}Why Waldgeflüster for Your Winter Event?{% endset %}
